	(text_box "Design Requirements:\n1) Vcc = 3.3V\n2) Vmon1 = 3.3V -5%\n3) Vmon2 = 1.8V - 5%\n4) Vmon3 = 1.8V - 5%\n5) Vmon4 = 1.0V +- 5%\n6) Start-up time = 300ms\n\nVoltage Rails:\n\nVmonx_tgt = (1 + RxH / RxL) * 0.4\nTODO: Fill out calcs here!\n\nStart-up time:\n- Pullup CT1-CT4 to VCC w/ 100k resistors forces fixed 300ms\n\nReset Logic:\n- If any voltage rails fall out of bounds, reset ALL components.\n- If watchdog fails, reset ALL components.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237.49 53.34 0)
		(size 43.18 57.5409)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
